<title>USA: K2 Inc Q4 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>K2 Inc Q4 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>SUMMARY OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>		   (in thousands except for per share figures)</p>
<p>			     FOURTH QUARTER	    YEAR ENDED</p>
<p>				ended Dec. 31		Dec. 31</p>
<p>				 (unaudited)</p>
<p>				1996	 1995	 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales	   $ 152,844  $ 135,743  $ 602,734  $ 544,268</p>
<p>Operating income</p>
<p>			    10,830	8,762     44,356     37,086</p>
<p>   Net income	    6,321	(158)     25,217     14,879</p>
<p>Per share:</p>
<p>Continuing</p>
<p>    operations	    0.38	 0.29	 1.51	 1.37</p>
<p>Discontinued</p>
<p>    operations	    0.00     (0.30)	 0.00     (0.34)</p>
<p>   Net income	     0.38     (0.01)	 1.51	 1.03</p>
<p>Average shares   outstanding	   16,742     16,664     16,734     14,498</p>
<p>NOTE: Assuming the June 1995 public offering had been completed on January 1, 1995, net per share from continuing operations were $1.51 for Q4 1996 vs $1.27 for Q4 1995.</p>
</text>
